@startuml 12-seq-officer-reads-tor
!include style.iuml
title API sequence - officer finds, reads and verifies a TOR
autonumber
actor "BD Officer" as O
participant "Web" as W
participant "API" as A
database "MongoDB" as DB
participant "e-GP" as E
O -> W : search, filter status = open
W -> A : GET /api/tors?q=...&status=open
A -> DB : query (audience = officer)
A --> W : { items, total } - tor_analysed only
O -> W : open a result
W -> A : GET /api/tors/{projectId}
A --> W : Procurement (analysis, timeline, archive manifest)
O -> W : view the source TOR
W -> A : GET /api/tors/{projectId}/source
A -> DB : read archive.zipId and the main_tor member
A -> E : downloadFileTest(zipId)
E --> A : ZIP
A -> A : extract the main TOR PDF
A --> W : application/pdf
O -> W : favourite, or report if it is wrong
W -> A : POST /api/favorites   or   POST /api/tors/{id}/reports
A --> W : 201
@enduml
